# ---> Begin: placeholder for gradlew wrapper script.
# This project ships the standard Gradle wrapper properties.
# Run `./gradlew wrapper` once in Android Studio, or download the
# official gradlew / gradlew.bat scripts from a Gradle distribution
# and place them at the project root, then run:
#   ./gradlew assembleDebug
# The wrapper jar is intentionally not committed here; Android Studio
# generates it on first import. See README.md.
